{"pickle":{"id":"cb87e0f3-490e-4038-8aa0-89ee32f4880e","uri":"features/crvs_notify.feature","astNodeIds":["51c746d3-5890-4f0f-bb48-44240fd14bf2","9be476d8-bd2a-4960-996c-a894cbdd857c"],"name":"An invalid notification is rejected: name with no name part","language":"en","steps":[{"id":"93ee8149-7c40-4842-9d4b-062d8097ecbe","text":"the \"notify\" endpoint","type":"Context","astNodeIds":["92de8539-c603-4367-b0b7-8ff4fadd7e74"]},{"id":"13e87732-c9a5-4ae2-826e-a4aa175dd3da","text":"a valid request","type":"Context","astNodeIds":["6aa981bf-afc1-4983-a495-4fb71ef7e61c","9be476d8-bd2a-4960-996c-a894cbdd857c"]},{"id":"6e7b6101-3b25-4c63-98c0-26f29aa07856","text":"the request field \"message.notify_event.0.data.reg_records.0.name\" becomes '{\"prefix\":\"Baby\"}'","type":"Context","astNodeIds":["bd7db542-cc89-4c5c-a8d7-1b202d0b3eb5","9be476d8-bd2a-4960-996c-a894cbdd857c"]},{"id":"6bbc310a-1d83-45c6-9db1-cb330b0721fc","text":"the request is sent","type":"Action","astNodeIds":["328fdb69-3b8d-47bb-b94b-ebbdb8ca5af3","9be476d8-bd2a-4960-996c-a894cbdd857c"]},{"id":"5ec31b3f-9136-4558-8821-cb21ba558df2","text":"the request should be rejected according to the DCI error model","type":"Outcome","astNodeIds":["00e6f1e9-86fa-4a3c-ab7d-c05016b45ec4","9be476d8-bd2a-4960-996c-a894cbdd857c"]}],"tags":[{"name":"@method=POST","astNodeId":"6e2b8b26-5fdb-411d-a35b-471ba614cbe7"},{"name":"@endpoint=crvs/notify","astNodeId":"5f85e375-9868-4bce-96d7-ebb08eea186b"},{"name":"@negative","astNodeId":"9400211e-bb7a-4a2b-acfe-aac9b9020653"},{"name":"@strict-data","astNodeId":"e5bc8670-60c6-4cdc-86cd-2fffea81fdc3"}]}}
{"pickle":{"id":"21eba50a-b082-4c33-9661-478c6efd254c","uri":"features/crvs_notify.feature","astNodeIds":["51c746d3-5890-4f0f-bb48-44240fd14bf2","e3f952c4-33c4-48fd-8642-f3bb789e75cb"],"name":"An invalid notification is rejected: birth place longitude","language":"en","steps":[{"id":"3d740171-46d0-4526-9d5c-07674f9b9811","text":"the \"notify\" endpoint","type":"Context","astNodeIds":["92de8539-c603-4367-b0b7-8ff4fadd7e74"]},{"id":"3a474285-795c-4cf7-8a99-7836c055eb7a","text":"a valid request","type":"Context","astNodeIds":["6aa981bf-afc1-4983-a495-4fb71ef7e61c","e3f952c4-33c4-48fd-8642-f3bb789e75cb"]},{"id":"7e703c7a-a254-49a3-85e9-f566bf71756a","text":"the request field \"message.notify_event.0.data.reg_records.0.birth_place.geo\" becomes '{\"latitude\":6.4,\"longitude\":300}'","type":"Context","astNodeIds":["bd7db542-cc89-4c5c-a8d7-1b202d0b3eb5","e3f952c4-33c4-48fd-8642-f3bb789e75cb"]},{"id":"e18f9c24-bf27-4ca5-80a7-2e79cf4fc1a8","text":"the request is sent","type":"Action","astNodeIds":["328fdb69-3b8d-47bb-b94b-ebbdb8ca5af3","e3f952c4-33c4-48fd-8642-f3bb789e75cb"]},{"id":"968e583c-b8f8-49ed-bc65-3e4800af6769","text":"the request should be rejected according to the DCI error model","type":"Outcome","astNodeIds":["00e6f1e9-86fa-4a3c-ab7d-c05016b45ec4","e3f952c4-33c4-48fd-8642-f3bb789e75cb"]}],"tags":[{"name":"@method=POST","astNodeId":"6e2b8b26-5fdb-411d-a35b-471ba614cbe7"},{"name":"@endpoint=crvs/notify","astNodeId":"5f85e375-9868-4bce-96d7-ebb08eea186b"},{"name":"@negative","astNodeId":"9400211e-bb7a-4a2b-acfe-aac9b9020653"},{"name":"@strict-data","astNodeId":"e5bc8670-60c6-4cdc-86cd-2fffea81fdc3"}]}}
{"source":{"data":"@method=POST @endpoint=crvs/on-search\nFeature: Receive async search results from the CRVS (POST /registry/on-search)\n\nThis API is exposed by the SP to receive search results from the CRVS.\nThe suite plays the CRVS: every payload it sends is first checked against the spec\n(including the person data rules), then the SP must acknowledge it.\n\n  Background:\n    Given the \"on-search\" endpoint\n\n  @smoke\n  Scenario: Successfully receive async search results from the CRVS\n    Given an on-search callback carrying the \"full\" person record\n    Then the request should be a valid \"on-search\" message\n    When the request is sent\n    Then the HTTP status should be 200\n    And the response should have a JSON content type\n    And the response should be received within 15000 ms\n    And the response should be a valid acknowledgement with ack_status \"ACK\"\n\n  @functional\n  Scenario Outline: Results carrying a <profile> person record are acknowledged\n    Given an on-search callback carrying the \"<profile>\" person record\n    Then the request should be a valid \"on-search\" message\n    When the request is sent\n    Then the response should be a valid acknowledgement with ack_status \"ACK\"\n\n    Examples:\n      | profile      |\n      | spec example |\n      | full         |\n      | minimal      |\n      | newborn      |\n      | deceased     |\n      | stillborn    |\n      | married      |\n      | divorced     |\n      | widow        |\n      | multi        |\n\n  @functional\n  Scenario: Results carrying several person records are acknowledged\n    Given an on-search callback carrying the person records \"full, newborn, married\"\n    Then the request should be a valid \"on-search\" message\n    When the request is sent\n    Then the response should be a valid acknowledgement with ack_status \"ACK\"\n\n  @functional\n  Scenario: An empty result is acknowledged\n    Given an on-search callback with an empty result\n    Then the request should be a valid \"on-search\" message\n    When the request is sent\n    Then the response should be a valid acknowledgement with ack_status \"ACK\"\n\n  @functional\n  Scenario Outline: A rejected search with reason code <code> is acknowledged\n    Given an on-search callback rejected with reason code \"<code>\"\n    Then the request should be a valid \"on-search\" message\n    When the request is sent\n    Then the response should be a valid acknowledgement with ack_status \"ACK\"\n\n    Examples: SearchStatusReasonCode\n      | code                               |\n      | rjct.reference_id.invalid          |\n      | rjct.reference_id.duplicate        |\n      | rjct.timestamp.invalid             |\n      | rjct.search_criteria.invalid       |\n      | rjct.filter.invalid                |\n      | rjct.sort.invalid                  |\n      | rjct.pagination.invalid            |\n      | rjct.search.too_many_records_found |\n\n  @negative\n  Scenario Outline: An invalid on-search callback is rejected: <case>\n    Given a valid request\n    And the request field \"<field>\" becomes '<value>'\n    When the request is sent\n    Then the request should be rejected according to the DCI error model\n\n    Examples: Envelope and header\n      | case                       | field                         | value          |\n      | missing header             | header                        | <removed>      |\n      | wrong action               | header.action                 | \"search\"       |\n      | missing header status      | header.status                 | <removed>      |\n      | unknown header status      | header.status                 | \"done\"         |\n      | unknown header reason code | header.status_reason_code     | \"rjct.unknown\" |\n      | missing message_ts         | header.message_ts             | <removed>      |\n\n    Examples: Search response\n      | case                         | field                                       | value             |\n      | missing transaction_id       | message.transaction_id                      | <removed>         |\n      | missing correlation_id       | message.correlation_id                      | <removed>         |\n      | correlation_id invalid chars | message.correlation_id                      | \"CRVS 0001\"       |\n      | missing search_response      | message.search_response                     | <removed>         |\n      | missing status               | message.search_response.0.status            | <removed>         |\n      | unknown status               | message.search_response.0.status            | \"ok\"              |\n      | unknown reason code          | message.search_response.0.status_reason_code | \"rjct.not_found\" |\n      | reason message too long      | message.search_response.0.status_reason_message | \"\" |\n      | data without reg_records     | message.search_response.0.data              | {\"version\":\"1.0.0\"} |\n      | pagination missing total     | message.search_response.0.pagination        | {\"page_size\":1,\"page_number\":1} |\n      | locale not ISO 639-3         | message.search_response.0.locale            | \"en\"              |\n\n    @strict-data\n    Examples: Person data in the result\n      | case                         | field                                                        | value                 |\n      | reg_records not an array     | message.search_response.0.data.reg_records                   | {\"sex\":\"female\"}      |\n      | sex outside code list        | message.search_response.0.data.reg_records.0.sex             | \"F\"                   |\n      | marital status outside list  | message.search_response.0.data.reg_records.0.marital_status  | \"married\"             |\n      | identifier type outside list | message.search_response.0.data.reg_records.0.identifier.0.identifier_type | \"NID\"  |\n      | birth_date not ISO 8601      | message.search_response.0.data.reg_records.0.birth_date      | \"23/03/1980\"          |\n      | phone not E.164              | message.search_response.0.data.reg_records.0.phone_number   | [\"0612345678\"]        |\n      | invalid e-mail               | message.search_response.0.data.reg_records.0.email          | [\"elena.example.com\"] |\n      | latitude out of range        | message.search_response.0.data.reg_records.0.birth_place.geo | {\"latitude\":120,\"longitude\":0} |\n      | country code not ISO 3166    | message.search_response.0.data.reg_records.0.address.country_code | \"Spain\"         |\n","uri":"features/crvs_on-search.feature","mediaType":"text/x.cucumber.gherkin+plain"}}
{"gherkinDocument":{"feature":{"tags":[{"location":{"line":1,"column":1},"name":"@method=POST","id":"d1542276-38b4-4754-b8b9-f513c72438a9"},{"location":{"line":1,"column":14},"name":"@endpoint=crvs/on-search","id":"644dc9dd-e26d-4542-b2ac-7e9093c3466d"}],"location":{"line":2,"column":1},"language":"en","keyword":"Feature","name":"Receive async search results from the CRVS (POST /registry/on-search)","description":"This API is exposed by the SP to receive search results from the CRVS.\nThe suite plays the CRVS: every payload it sends is first checked against the spec\n(including the person data rules), then the SP must acknowledge it.","children":[{"background":{"id":"4bbb6526-f508-4495-9120-1c13f0e01710","location":{"line":8,"column":3},"keyword":"Background","name":"","description":"","steps":[{"id":"93dfde2e-e22f-4131-a1da-902e3638fd0c","location":{"line":9,"column":5},"keyword":"Given ","keywordType":"Context","text":"the \"on-search\" endpoint"}]}},{"scenario":{"id":"18df552e-c84f-4e9f-a51d-b61ab93cad6b","tags":[{"location":{"line":11,"column":3},"name":"@smoke","id":"1f5c9443-fa5b-4e09-a464-89c805afffd7"}],"location":{"line":12,"column":3},"keyword":"Scenario","name":"Successfully receive async search results from the CRVS","description":"","steps":[{"id":"19166bd7-ae19-4a10-ab8a-6f4e6c348fff","location":{"line":13,"column":5},"keyword":"Given ","keywordType":"Context","text":"an on-search callback carrying the \"full\" person record"},{"id":"5c9a253f-6574-4f33-b90a-d1e5e519fdb8","location":{"line":14,"column":5},"keyword":"Then ","keywordType":"Outcome","text":"the request should be a valid \"on-search\" message"},{"id":"ff84bace-a717-4ba2-b23f-8e0ae062b797","location":{"line":15,"column":5},"keyword":"When ","keywordType":"Action","text":"the request is sent"},{"id":"f230c00c-7147-4a2b-b2f9-d5f45e6bfc15","location":{"line":16,"column":5},"keyword":"Then ","keywordType":"Outcome","text":"the HTTP status should be 200"},{"id":"06c9a220-2ad8-4f59-b8e8-9edfbc9718