{"pickle":{"id":"7f7623a7-9745-43ff-a185-80e885253109","uri":"features/crvs_on-subscribe.feature","astNodeIds":["d8ba3af4-f2df-448d-9543-0191cfbcc0ec","61456cee-6fcc-43fe-8e90-ca8a05a99330"],"name":"An invalid on-subscribe callback is rejected: unknown vital event","language":"en","steps":[{"id":"a8614b8e-3c25-4ee2-b5dc-bff5103f9804","text":"the \"on-subscribe\" endpoint","type":"Context","astNodeIds":["5abc5ee2-c41c-4314-937b-9dedc523598a"]},{"id":"2328db20-e3db-4477-8e3d-8c15dd65ac5b","text":"a valid request","type":"Context","astNodeIds":["e0400003-f35a-4b49-a9da-470861ac95f1","61456cee-6fcc-43fe-8e90-ca8a05a99330"]},{"id":"7428a18d-e10b-48a8-840c-a2df94f09489","text":"the request field \"message.subscribe_response.0.subscriptions.0.reg_event_type\" becomes '\"graduation\"'","type":"Context","astNodeIds":["4945b1d5-3849-4de2-b168-b1ec323a81d3","61456cee-6fcc-43fe-8e90-ca8a05a99330"]},{"id":"54c22288-308d-479b-bc3d-502eaa94dc89","text":"the request is sent","type":"Action","astNodeIds":["50e8ba55-34e1-4e62-b0d1-c41a3b2de5cf","61456cee-6fcc-43fe-8e90-ca8a05a99330"]},{"id":"6f6eee87-579b-4b16-aaa7-bcbbb2494f42","text":"the request should be rejected according to the DCI error model","type":"Outcome","astNodeIds":["f1ea944a-8783-4047-8153-03806c6c3e6b","61456cee-6fcc-43fe-8e90-ca8a05a99330"]}],"tags":[{"name":"@method=POST","astNodeId":"11ead904-df35-494a-bd15-202b5bc7b54c"},{"name":"@endpoint=crvs/on-subscribe","astNodeId":"27cdc3c0-a786-4aa0-a699-23304e027ffa"},{"name":"@negative","astNodeId":"08da467e-a89e-4606-83e5-7937d2776980"}]}}
{"source":{"data":"@method=POST @endpoint=crvs/on-unsubscribe\nFeature: Receive the unsubscribe result from the CRVS (POST /registry/on-unsubscribe)\n\nThis API is exposed by the SP to receive the result of an unsubscribe request.\n\n  Background:\n    Given the \"on-unsubscribe\" endpoint\n\n  @smoke\n  Scenario: Successfully receive a confirmed unsubscription\n    Given an on-unsubscribe callback confirming the unsubscription\n    Then the request should be a valid \"on-unsubscribe\" message\n    When the request is sent\n    Then the HTTP status should be 200\n    And the response should have a JSON content type\n    And the response should be received within 15000 ms\n    And the response should be a valid acknowledgement with ack_status \"ACK\"\n\n  @functional\n  Scenario Outline: A refused unsubscription with reason code <code> is acknowledged\n    Given an on-unsubscribe callback rejected with reason code \"<code>\"\n    Then the request should be a valid \"on-unsubscribe\" message\n    When the request is sent\n    Then the response should be a valid acknowledgement with ack_status \"ACK\"\n\n    Examples: UnSubscribeStatusReasonCode\n      | code                            |\n      | rjct.reference_id.invalid       |\n      | rjct.reference_id.duplicate     |\n      | rjct.timestamp.invalid          |\n      | rjct.subscription_code.invalid  |\n      | rjct.requester.invalid          |\n      | rjct.event.already_unsubscribed |\n\n  @negative\n  Scenario Outline: An invalid on-unsubscribe callback is rejected: <case>\n    Given a valid request\n    And the request field \"<field>\" becomes '<value>'\n    When the request is sent\n    Then the request should be rejected according to the DCI error model\n\n    Examples:\n      | case                         | field                                   | value             |\n      | missing header               | header                                  | <removed>         |\n      | wrong action                 | header.action                           | \"unsubscribe\"     |\n      | missing message              | message                                 | <removed>         |\n      | missing timestamp            | message.timestamp                       | <removed>         |\n      | missing status               | message.status                          | <removed>         |\n      | unknown status               | message.status                          | \"done\"            |\n      | unknown reason code          | message.status_reason_code              | \"rjct.filter.invalid\" |\n      | subscription status unknown  | message.subscription_status.0.status    | \"cancelled\"       |\n      | subscription status no code  | message.subscription_status.0.code      | <removed>         |\n","uri":"features/crvs_on-unsubscribe.feature","mediaType":"text/x.cucumber.gherkin+plain"}}
