{"pickle":{"id":"c9fae14a-bb96-485e-8f15-2b044dae6781","uri":"features/crvs_txn_on-status.feature","astNodeIds":["d936cc52-48e6-42b0-aa4b-7aecf779801d","7b0c6c8e-84da-41c3-bfce-05d6beb1e326"],"name":"An invalid txn/on-status callback is rejected: search result with invalid status","language":"en","steps":[{"id":"a8996244-826e-446f-bc58-54bdb4e0f795","text":"the \"txn on-status\" endpoint","type":"Context","astNodeIds":["06af2def-19a7-420a-af2e-a86eb930c88b"]},{"id":"c72ad647-7cd6-4d77-a2da-be21f0dfeb7d","text":"a valid request","type":"Context","astNodeIds":["533c5d2d-974c-4043-88e6-a2682e2f7d29","7b0c6c8e-84da-41c3-bfce-05d6beb1e326"]},{"id":"5aacaa18-d0b0-4cea-aca8-00df51384d52","text":"the request field \"message.txnstatus_response.txn_status.search_response.0.status\" becomes '\"found\"'","type":"Context","astNodeIds":["1f5f4ea5-f316-45f8-a8e5-127a5f7484b5","7b0c6c8e-84da-41c3-bfce-05d6beb1e326"]},{"id":"72f4a700-d686-4f26-b5b1-c77d43125c12","text":"the request is sent","type":"Action","astNodeIds":["6a52feae-759c-4d1c-b57d-8ad872b9b920","7b0c6c8e-84da-41c3-bfce-05d6beb1e326"]},{"id":"76b8434d-4ce9-4236-941f-a9092f06660b","text":"the request should be rejected according to the DCI error model","type":"Outcome","astNodeIds":["f64e05c5-8c9c-4df8-90ce-b51443d9b437","7b0c6c8e-84da-41c3-bfce-05d6beb1e326"]}],"tags":[{"name":"@method=POST","astNodeId":"b56b9b79-4cf4-429b-bdd0-0d84e3c8137b"},{"name":"@endpoint=crvs/txn/on-status","astNodeId":"619f5fe9-7619-4b49-8f9e-50fe15110a6b"},{"name":"@negative","astNodeId":"d3fda085-b6dd-421d-9dee-e8878208e846"}]}}
{"pickle":{"id":"fef92e3d-cc7a-4bdc-b548-0f9699f95ae6","uri":"features/crvs_txn_on-status.feature","astNodeIds":["d936cc52-48e6-42b0-aa4b-7aecf779801d","b604eb86-e728-44fe-8751-12cbbfbb4b7d"],"name":"An invalid txn/on-status callback is rejected: search result without data records","language":"en","steps":[{"id":"3e442042-c885-4b95-bce4-b6c1bb99cff8","text":"the \"txn on-status\" endpoint","type":"Context","astNodeIds":["06af2def-19a7-420a-af2e-a86eb930c88b"]},{"id":"216103e8-9f59-494c-9f89-fe096d608c8a","text":"a valid request","type":"Context","astNodeIds":["533c5d2d-974c-4043-88e6-a2682e2f7d29","b604eb86-e728-44fe-8751-12cbbfbb4b7d"]},{"id":"4354b935-be1f-408a-81ff-55e0685511a0","text":"the request field \"message.txnstatus_response.txn_status.search_response.0.data\" becomes '{\"reg_record_type\":\"Person\"}'","type":"Context","astNodeIds":["1f5f4ea5-f316-45f8-a8e5-127a5f7484b5","b604eb86-e728-44fe-8751-12cbbfbb4b7d"]},{"id":"b7c75d18-6dbd-4513-b23c-9269895a190e","text":"the request is sent","type":"Action","astNodeIds":["6a52feae-759c-4d1c-b57d-8ad872b9b920","b604eb86-e728-44fe-8751-12cbbfbb4b7d"]},{"id":"2fb1152b-c017-4b6b-8e7f-a96ac05d5b78","text":"the request should be rejected according to the DCI error model","type":"Outcome","astNodeIds":["f64e05c5-8c9c-4df8-90ce-b51443d9b437","b604eb86-e728-44fe-8751-12cbbfbb4b7d"]}],"tags":[{"name":"@method=POST","astNodeId":"b56b9b79-4cf4-429b-bdd0-0d84e3c8137b"},{"name":"@endpoint=crvs/txn/on-status","astNodeId":"619f5fe9-7619-4b49-8f9e-50fe15110a6b"},{"name":"@negative","astNodeId":"d3fda085-b6dd-421d-9dee-e8878208e846"}]}}
{"source":{"data":"@method=POST @endpoint=crvs/txn/status\nFeature: Asynchronous transaction status check (POST /registry/txn/status)\n\nThis API is exposed by the CRVS and called by SP systems or other registries.\nThe CRVS acknowledges the request and delivers a TxnStatusResponse to the\ntxn/on-status callback.\n\n  Background:\n    Given the \"txn status\" endpoint\n\n  @smoke\n  Scenario: A transaction status request is acknowledged\n    Given a transaction status request for \"search\" transactions by \"transaction_id\"\n    Then the request should be a valid \"txn-status\" message\n    When the request is sent\n    Then the HTTP status should be 200\n    And the response should have a JSON content type\n    And the response should be received within 15000 ms\n    And the response should be a valid acknowledgement with ack_status \"ACK\"\n\n  @functional\n  Scenario Outline: Status of a <txn type> transaction looked up by <attribute type> is acknowledged\n    Given a transaction status request for \"<txn type>\" transactions by \"<attribute type>\"\n    Then the request should be a valid \"txn-status\" message\n    When the request is sent\n    Then the response should be a valid acknowledgement with ack_status \"ACK\"\n\n    Examples:\n      | txn type    | attribute type         |\n      | search      | transaction_id         |\n      | search      | reference_id_list      |\n      | search      | correlation_id         |\n      | subscribe   | transaction_id         |\n      | subscribe   | subscription_code_list |\n      | unsubscribe | subscription_code_list |\n      | unsubscribe | correlation_id         |\n\n  @callback\n  Scenario Outline: The status of a <txn type> transaction is delivered to the txn/on-status callback\n    Given a transaction status request for \"<txn type>\" transactions by \"<attribute type>\"\n    And the callback listener is used as sender_uri\n    When the request is sent\n    Then the response should be a valid acknowledgement with ack_status \"ACK\"\n    And an \"txn-on-status\" callback should be received\n    And the callback should be a valid \"txn-on-status\" message\n    And the transaction status should be reported for a \"<txn type>\" transaction\n    And every returned person record should be valid CRVS person data\n\n    Examples:\n      | txn type    | attribute type         |\n      | search      | transaction_id         |\n      | subscribe   | subscription_code_list |\n      | unsubscribe | subscription_code_list |\n\n  @negative\n  Scenario Outline: An invalid transaction status request is rejected: <case>\n    Given a valid request\n    And the request field \"<field>\" becomes '<value>'\n    When the request is sent\n    Then the request should be rejected according to the DCI error model\n\n    Examples:\n      | case                               | field                                       | value               |\n      | missing header                     | header                                      | <removed>           |\n      | wrong action                       | header.action                               | \"txn-on-status\"     |\n      | missing message                    | message                                     | <removed>           |\n      | missing transaction_id             | message.transaction_id                      | <removed>           |\n      | missing txnstatus_request          | message.txnstatus_request                   | <removed>           |\n      | missing reference_id               | message.txnstatus_request.reference_id      | <removed>           |\n      | unknown txn_type                   | message.txnstatus_request.txn_type          | \"notify\"            |\n      | unknown attribute_type             | message.txnstatus_request.attribute_type    | \"message_id\"        |\n      | missing attribute_value            | message.txnstatus_request.attribute_value   | <removed>           |\n      | reference_id_list given a string   | message.txnstatus_request                   | {\"reference_id\":\"R1\",\"txn_type\":\"search\",\"attribute_type\":\"reference_id_list\",\"attribute_value\":\"R1\"} |\n      | transaction_id given a list        | message.txnstatus_request                   | {\"reference_id\":\"R1\",\"txn_type\":\"search\",\"attribute_type\":\"transaction_id\",\"attribute_value\":[\"T1\"]} |\n      | correlation_id with invalid chars  | message.txnstatus_request                   | {\"reference_id\":\"R1\",\"txn_type\":\"search\",\"attribute_type\":\"correlation_id\",\"attribute_value\":\"abc/123\"} |\n      | invalid locale                     | message.txnstatus_request.locale            | \"e\"                 |\n","uri":"features/crvs_txn_status.feature","mediaType":"text/x.cucumber.gherkin+plain"}}
